---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.jsx';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Lifio" 
  description="Privacy Policy for the Lifio app. Learn how we handle your data."
>
  <main class="container" style="padding-top: 6rem; padding-bottom: 6rem; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="card" style="padding: 3rem;">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-muted);"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      
      <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Welcome to Lifio. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it. 
          This Privacy Policy explains that we do not collect, store, or share your personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">2. Data Collection & Storage (Local First)</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Lifio is designed as a "local-first" application. All data you enter into the app—including your name, notes, habits, and health tracking data—is stored entirely locally on your device.
        </p>
        <ul style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> require you to create an account.</li>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> transmit your personal data to external servers.</li>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> use analytics software to track your behavior within the app.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Lifio does not integrate with any third-party services that collect user data. There are no tracking scripts, ads, or hidden data harvesting mechanics.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">4. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Because Lifio does not collect any personal data, it is inherently safe for children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13.
        </p>
      </section>
      
      <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">5. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">6. Contact Us</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:support@lifio.app" style="color: var(--color-primary-blue); font-weight: 500;">support@lifio.app</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <Footer client:idle />
</Layout>
